      "notes": "ALWAYS insert a draft, regardless of autonomy mode -- full audit trail either way, matching the project's core design principle (every AI decision logged). status is 'auto_sent' or 'pending' depending on mode (set upstream in Determine Action). The 'pending' case surfaces in the dashboard's existing Pending Approvals screen for free -- no new UI needed."
    },
